From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 22:31:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] NetPlay: VMNetUndoBuyCmd, take back an object bought this
 session

For Simitone's buy/build undo (roadmap 12). TS1 only. Deletes the
object (entry point 12, as a delete does) and refunds InitialPrice, the
price paid; VMNetDeleteObjectCmd refunds the current value, which for a
new TS1 object is 80% (wear starts at 20). Verified like a delete
(user movable, no transaction in progress) plus a GUID check so a
recycled object ID is never removed. Command type 49.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019q6m8f542cVUMKg755aFtZ
---
